WEBVTT

00:00:00.202 --> 00:00:05.132
Neil passed himself as Terry
and lured Candy in a villa.

00:00:05.282 --> 00:00:08.074
However, Candy ran away.

00:00:08.777 --> 00:00:16.544
The real Terry came to Chicago and
looked secretly at a happy Candy.

00:00:16.694 --> 00:00:20.146
Then, he decided to go back
to his passion, the theatre.

00:00:20.823 --> 00:00:24.691
A man leaves

00:00:46.815 --> 00:00:51.998
Candy, sorry I didn't tell you
that I have recovered my memory.

00:00:52.254 --> 00:00:55.458
Now that I know who I am,
I won't bother you again.

00:00:55.758 --> 00:01:00.054
Thank you very much.

00:01:04.833 --> 00:01:10.169
You'd like to say goodbye to Candy?
You can go to her.

00:01:23.085 --> 00:01:28.113
Poope, it's still early, let me sleep.

00:01:35.664 --> 00:01:37.495
Goodbye, Candy.

00:01:48.811 --> 00:01:50.904
Goodbye, Candy.

00:02:10.566 --> 00:02:15.128
It's such a wonderful day!
Good morning little birds!

00:02:18.273 --> 00:02:21.208
Now it's time to get ready,
let's go!

00:02:27.282 --> 00:02:32.513
Mr. Albert is already up,
he lit up the fire. What's that?

00:02:32.663 --> 00:02:37.184
He even prepared the breakfast!

00:02:38.427 --> 00:02:40.224
A letter?

00:02:43.365 --> 00:02:48.098
Mr. Albert... Mr. Albert!

00:02:49.672 --> 00:02:51.299
Mr. Albert...

00:02:58.714 --> 00:03:04.144
He came here earlier, but first
let me wake up, I am still asleep.

00:03:04.294 --> 00:03:08.588
Did he tell you where he went?

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:12.886
You want to travel?

00:03:13.036 --> 00:03:14.622
Yes, and I wanted to thank you
before leaving.

00:03:14.772 --> 00:03:16.390
But, Albert...

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:21.662
Doctor, please take care of Candy.

00:03:21.812 --> 00:03:23.637
Albert!

00:03:32.848 --> 00:03:35.751
I saw him getting in a car
that was waiting for him.

00:03:35.901 --> 00:03:36.894
A car?

00:03:37.044 --> 00:03:40.748
I think there were two men inside.

00:03:40.898 --> 00:03:44.585
It might be those
who people talk about.

00:03:44.735 --> 00:03:49.757
I saw him talking with two men,
I couldn't hear what they were saying.

00:03:49.907 --> 00:03:51.992
I have to admit I am a bit worried.

00:03:52.142 --> 00:03:54.528
You think he was kidnapped by them?

00:03:54.678 --> 00:03:56.363
I doubt it.

00:03:56.513 --> 00:03:59.505
I have to go and look for him.

00:04:32.307 --> 00:04:35.436
Where are you, Mr. Albert?

00:04:35.586 --> 00:04:38.572
I really liked to take care of you.

00:04:38.722 --> 00:04:45.377
Whatever happened to you,
you didn't have to leave.

00:04:46.388 --> 00:04:49.516
Once, you said...

00:04:54.897 --> 00:04:59.129
Candy, it's good to share with you.

00:04:59.935 --> 00:05:06.465
I would really like it
if you could confide in me.

00:05:06.642 --> 00:05:08.269
Mr. Albert...

00:05:09.745 --> 00:05:12.407
Then it's a deal!

00:05:14.116 --> 00:05:18.011
Why did you change your mind
so suddenly?

00:05:18.161 --> 00:05:23.149
Mr. Albert, you can come to me
whenever you need me.

00:05:26.762 --> 00:05:31.222
I am all alone, again...

00:05:40.142 --> 00:05:44.872
Mother, do you know
that Candy is working at a clinic?

00:05:45.022 --> 00:05:51.678
What? She is not supposed
to find any job in this city!

00:05:51.828 --> 00:05:54.748
But she still managed to find a job.

00:05:54.898 --> 00:05:57.117
Does Neil know she is still here?

00:05:57.267 --> 00:05:58.218
I think so.

00:05:58.368 --> 00:06:00.120
That's not good.

00:06:02.064 --> 00:06:08.595
Mother, you have to make her go away,
otherwise we'll be in trouble again.

00:06:08.745 --> 00:06:11.366
Brother is attracted to Candy.

00:06:11.607 --> 00:06:13.167
Do you have any idea?

00:06:13.317 --> 00:06:20.641
Aunt Elroy will get rid of her if we say
it's an order from Grandfather William.

00:06:20.791 --> 00:06:23.544
But, if Grandfather William knows
about this lie...

00:06:23.694 --> 00:06:29.449
Apparently Grandfather William is ill,
he wouldn't be able to do anything.

00:06:29.599 --> 00:06:34.822
Mother, Aunt Elroy hates Candy,
she will approve what we planned.

00:06:34.972 --> 00:06:37.024
No, you can't do this!

00:06:37.174 --> 00:06:38.458
Brother!

00:06:38.608 --> 00:06:41.495
Did you hear what we said?

00:06:41.645 --> 00:06:47.351
Everything! Mother, I am
serious with Candy. I love her.

00:06:47.501 --> 00:06:49.236
Neil!

00:06:49.386 --> 00:06:53.273
Brother, do you realize
what you're saying?

00:06:53.423 --> 00:06:57.648
Yes, I love her.
I have always loved her!

00:06:58.787 --> 00:07:05.152
Brother, I am ashamed of you,
how can you love such a girl?

00:07:05.302 --> 00:07:09.527
I don't care what you think,
I will marry her!

00:07:11.633 --> 00:07:13.931
Mother!

00:07:18.073 --> 00:07:21.634
I didn't find Mr. Albert.

00:07:36.224 --> 00:07:39.421
Oh, this church looks
exactly like Pony's Home!

00:08:04.519 --> 00:08:06.387
Patty!

00:08:06.989 --> 00:08:13.887
You're shaking. You're praying
for Stear. I understand you perfectly.

00:08:14.037 --> 00:08:17.824
You are anxious about his safety.

00:08:17.974 --> 00:08:21.232
He is fighting in a war...

00:08:22.804 --> 00:08:24.863
Candy.

00:08:25.640 --> 00:08:27.039
Patty.

00:08:27.442 --> 00:08:32.470
Candy, I am nervous,
I am afraid something is going to happen.

00:08:32.948 --> 00:08:36.509
Everything is going to be all right.
Did you hear anything?

00:08:37.119 --> 00:08:42.113
Stear sent a letter,
I can't stay in place, I am so nervous!

00:08:44.926 --> 00:08:46.951
May I read it?

00:08:48.764 --> 00:08:55.294
Dear Patty, I wanted to write you
about my good friend Domi.

00:09:08.350 --> 00:09:09.509
Look, there he is!

00:09:09.659 --> 00:09:11.449
It's Domi's plane!

00:09:15.257 --> 00:09:18.988
Domi! Domi!

00:09:21.763 --> 00:09:23.087
Domi!

00:09:25.133 --> 00:09:27.124
Domi, stay with us.

00:09:27.436 --> 00:09:31.031
No, everybody died over there.
It's time for me to go, too.

00:09:31.181 --> 00:09:35.133
I... I am giving you
my fiancée’s picture.

00:09:36.278 --> 00:09:41.147
Don't ever make your girlfriend sad.

00:09:42.584 --> 00:09:47.112
Domi!

00:09:50.759 --> 00:09:56.173
Is this a reality of life?
Is this what war is all about?

00:09:56.323 --> 00:10:00.460
He's dead...

00:10:00.610 --> 00:10:03.834
He was so happy this morning...

00:10:05.307 --> 00:10:08.401
Why is war so cruel, why? Domi...

00:10:16.251 --> 00:10:21.815
I am so afraid
that Stear may be next!

00:10:21.965 --> 00:10:28.989
Patty, don't worry. He will not die.

00:10:39.608 --> 00:10:42.907
Stear, don't make Patty sad.

00:10:48.817 --> 00:10:53.220
Yes, I wanted to show you something.

00:10:56.158 --> 00:10:59.423
This is the musical happy box.
Stear gave it to me.

00:11:00.362 --> 00:11:01.755
He made it?

00:11:01.905 --> 00:11:04.321
Yes, he did.

00:11:06.234 --> 00:11:10.170
He told me to listen to it
every time I felt sad.

00:11:12.941 --> 00:11:15.136
It's really nice.

00:11:15.544 --> 00:11:18.445
You keep it.
I want you to be happy again.

00:11:18.813 --> 00:11:20.644
Thank you, Candy.

00:12:25.113 --> 00:12:27.741
Hey, Stear!

00:12:29.851 --> 00:12:32.279
We just got the order to attack.

00:12:32.429 --> 00:12:34.049
It comes at last.

00:13:20.502 --> 00:13:22.729
The sky is just like always.

00:13:22.879 --> 00:13:27.173
The only difference is
that we're in the middle of the war.

00:13:28.443 --> 00:13:31.935
Though I am nervous,
my heart is calm.

00:13:32.447 --> 00:13:34.972
What is the reason for all of this?

00:13:35.817 --> 00:13:38.308
Everything will be fine.

00:13:47.762 --> 00:13:50.457
Domi... Domi...
It's my turn to attack.

00:13:50.607 --> 00:13:55.401
I know you are watching over me,
and you'll protect me.

00:13:55.670 --> 00:14:03.406
Alistear, be careful,
come back safe and sound.

00:14:04.612 --> 00:14:07.941
Patty! Patty!

00:14:08.091 --> 00:14:10.951
Patty... why am I thinking
of you at this moment?

00:14:34.142 --> 00:14:35.700
The enemy!

00:14:53.862 --> 00:14:56.122
Patty, how long are you going
to listen that song?

00:14:56.272 --> 00:14:57.023
But...

00:14:57.173 --> 00:15:00.829
Well, if you keep listening to it,
you'll be overwhelmed with happiness!

00:15:01.102 --> 00:15:03.434
Candy, that would be great!

00:15:26.428 --> 00:15:28.658
Damn! I missed!

00:15:59.260 --> 00:16:00.960
Ah! But that's Domi!

00:16:03.031 --> 00:16:06.194
No, I can't shoot!

00:16:24.052 --> 00:16:28.580
Domi! I am sorry,
I couldn't keep my promise.

00:16:28.790 --> 00:16:30.724
Patty, Candy...

00:16:41.035 --> 00:16:44.493
Good bye, Patty.
Good bye, Candy.

00:16:59.787 --> 00:17:02.449
Ah, it broke...

00:17:02.957 --> 00:17:04.515
Patty!

00:17:37.258 --> 00:17:41.688
God Almighty,

00:17:41.838 --> 00:17:49.128
take the soul of Alistear Cornwell
and give him eternal rest.

00:17:49.278 --> 00:17:50.430
Amen.

00:17:50.580 --> 00:17:51.938
Amen.

00:17:59.847 --> 00:18:01.838
Stear!

00:18:20.068 --> 00:18:25.233
Stear was such a nice person!

00:18:38.419 --> 00:18:41.183
I lost a tire again!

00:18:57.171 --> 00:18:59.002
Candy, jump!

00:19:07.949 --> 00:19:10.356
What went wrong this time?

00:19:14.589 --> 00:19:18.457
I didn't expect that that will be
the last time I will see him.

00:19:19.794 --> 00:19:22.763
Here.
This is a special music box.

00:19:22.997 --> 00:19:24.190
What is it?

00:19:24.340 --> 00:19:29.162
Candy, each time you will open it,
you will be filled with happiness.

00:19:29.312 --> 00:19:30.730
Thank you, Stear.

00:19:30.880 --> 00:19:33.365
Take care, Candy.

00:19:38.346 --> 00:19:39.711
Patty.

00:19:40.581 --> 00:19:47.316
I had it repaired.
The jeweller said it's a masterpiece.

00:19:47.822 --> 00:19:49.585
Patty.

00:20:14.015 --> 00:20:17.510
See you, Candy, Annie and Archie.

00:20:17.660 --> 00:20:21.781
The weather in Florida is excellent.
You will get well quickly.

00:20:21.931 --> 00:20:23.817
Thank you, Candy.

00:20:24.007 --> 00:20:27.400
Don't forget that, even if we are
apart, we are still friends.

00:20:27.570 --> 00:20:28.922
Yes, Annie.

00:20:29.172 --> 00:20:32.792
Patty, be happy.
Stear would want it too.

00:20:32.942 --> 00:20:36.728
I will be fine, as long as I am holding
the music box of happiness.

00:20:38.506 --> 00:20:41.200
Patty, get on the train!

00:20:41.350 --> 00:20:43.736
Granny, please take good care of Patty.

00:20:43.886 --> 00:20:50.512
Yes, Patty will be with her family,
her parents are waiting for her.

00:20:52.453 --> 00:20:54.180
Good bye, Candy.

00:20:54.330 --> 00:20:57.019
Good bye, Patty.

00:20:57.492 --> 00:21:00.757
Good bye, Archie, Annie!

00:21:04.332 --> 00:21:12.365
Candy prayed that her friend
would find happiness again,

00:21:12.515 --> 00:21:16.342
and she hoped that Stear's music box
of happiness will make her smile soon.

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:21.000
video file & English subtitles: Safex
fixed by Rémi
